  "releaseNotes": "Requires Serilog 4.4.0 or later. Events are now buffered and sent in batches, failed batches are retried, and the buffer is flushed when the logger is closed, so events logged just before a process exits are no longer lost. Close the logger (Log.CloseAndFlush, Log.CloseAndFlushAsync, or disposing the logger) before exit. Compatible with railtown.ai gateway v2.",
